248
00:22:47,778 --> 00:22:49,401
Si pudiera...

249
00:22:49,581 --> 00:22:52,531
Si pudiera, iría a su casa...

250
00:22:53,193 --> 00:22:54,872
Iría y...

251
00:22:55,015 --> 00:22:58,811
la encontraría sentada
en la mesa de la cocina, y...

252
00:22:58,986 --> 00:23:01,508
